<title>USA: COMEX and NYMEX metals trading suspended -exchange.</title>
<headline>COMEX and NYMEX metals trading suspended -exchange.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>COMEX and NYMEX metals contracts trading has been suspended due to technical problems with the ticker tape feed, a spokeswoman for the exchange said.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
